dtNotes — Common Desktop Environment (CDE) Rich Text, Markdown, & Plain Text Editor
Replaces stock dtpad with multi-tab editing, native .rtf reading/writing, .md Markdown
editing + live rendered preview, and crisp .txt / code editing (GtkSourceView 4).
Styled natively to match CDE's active OSF/Motif palette.
"""

